  "question": "The retail supermarket needs to develop a membership points management system to manage members' points, shopping records, and point redemption records.\n  The system shall record basic information of members, including Member ID, Name, Phone Number, and Current Points. Each member shall have a unique Member ID.\n  Each time a member shops, the system shall record the Shopping Time, Total Price of Goods, and Points Change. The shopping record shall be associated with the member, and each purchase shall affect the member's points (increase or decrease).\n  In addition, the system shall also record members' point redemption records, including Redemption Time, Redeemed Product Name, Redemption Quantity, and Points Consumed. Each redemption shall reduce the member's points, and the redemption record shall also be associated with the member.\n  The system shall support querying all shopping records, all point redemption records, and current points of a specific member.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0046\n\nCREATE TABLE `members` (\n  `member_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(100) NOT NULL,\n  `phone_number` varchar(20) NOT NULL,\n  `current_points` int(11) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  PRIMARY KEY (`member_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `phone_number` (`phone_number`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `shopping_records` (\n  `shopping_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `member_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `shopping_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `total_price` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  `points_change` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`shopping_id`),\n  KEY `member_id` (`member_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `shopping_records_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`member_id`) REFERENCES `members` (`member_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `redemption_records` (\n  `redemption_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `member_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `redemption_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `product_name` varchar(200) NOT NULL,\n  `redemption_quantity` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `points_consumed` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`redemption_id`),\n  KEY `member_id` (`member_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `redemption_records_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`member_id`) REFERENCES `members` (`member_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
